 "remarks": "First time on the market in 29 years! This fabulous 3,512 sq. ft. unique space in the heart of downtown SoNo is a rare find. It has three levels, two bathrooms, a kitchen, and views of the Long Island Sound. Loft-like space, high ceilings, very tall windows with great light. Fully outfitted with glass-structured offices. A conference room. Four parking spaces at the garage across the street. Elevator building. Furnished or Unfurnished. Bring your business to the hottest neighborhood in Fairfield County. Just steps to the South Norwalk Train Station, less than one hour to Grand Central. Easy access to I95, Route 7 and the Merritt Parkway.",
